# Differences meant between this text's PDF (as pdftotext reads it) and its web page, for tools/check_text.py.
# OLD=NEW: the PDF text says OLD, the page says NEW. "order: <start of a paragraph>": pdftotext reads it out of order.
# Jak's correction for the web page (27 November 2026); the PDF still says "analyzes":
analyzes=analyses
# Words split at the end of a line inside list items, which pdftotext leaves split:
meth- ods=methods
re- ported=reported
un- explained=unexplained
# pdftotext reads this reference's arXiv number before its title; the PDF prints the title first:
order: Anthropic (2026). Emotion Concepts
